    "Decision Room is the operational environment where organisations inspect reasoning, monitor drift, track precedent, assign accountability, and preserve decision continuity over time.": "Decision Room is de operationele omgeving waar organisaties redenering inspecteren, drift monitoren, precedent volgen, accountability toewijzen en besluitcontinuïteit in de tijd behouden.",
